---
---
<section id="about" class="w-full px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-[var(--ink-faint)]/40">
  <!-- Section Label -->
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mb-10">
    <span class="accent-hover-bracket inline-block font-mono text-[11px] text-[var(--ink)] tracking-[0.1em] border border-[var(--ink-faint)] px-2.5 py-1 select-none w-fit bg-[#12110E]/80">
      <span class="bracket">[</span> 01 / ABOUT <span class="bracket">]</span>
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-start">
    <!-- Bio Prose Column (Left 65% ~ 8 cols out of 12) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-6 font-serif text-[16px] text-[var(--ink)] leading-[1.85]">
      <p>
        I spend my days keeping cloud infrastructure from falling apart &mdash; AWS, mostly, for clients who can't afford downtime. The kind of work that's invisible when it goes right and very loud when it doesn't.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside that, I shoot film and fill sketchbooks. Both are about noticing things slowly, which is the opposite of what I do at work. The tension is the point.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is my corner of the internet. No personal brand, no funnel. Just the work and the things I find interesting.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Tabular Metadata Column with Vertical Hairline Left Divider (Right 35% ~ 4 cols out of 12) -->
    <div class="md:col-span-4 pl-0 md:pl-8 border-l-0 md:border-l border-[var(--ink-faint)]/40 flex flex-col gap-6">
      <div class="font-mono text-[11px] flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <span class="text-[var(--ink-faint)] font-medium">location</span>
          <span class="text-[var(--ink)]">kochi, kerala</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <span class="text-[var(--ink-faint)] font-medium">day job</span>
          <span class="text-[var(--ink)]">cloud / devops @ saints & masters</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <span class="text-[var(--ink-faint)] font-medium">currently</span>
          <span class="text-[var(--ink)]">shooting 35mm, reading, drawing</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
